  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Add a configuration option which allows administrators to specify what digest algorithm fedora should tell the OCFL client to use for all files stored. It should default to SHA512.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At the moment, the ocfl client allows the algorithm to be specified as follows:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "new OcflRepositoryBuilder()",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ".ocflConfig(new OcflConfig()",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ".setDefaultDigestAlgorithm(DigestAlgorithm.sha256))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "May relate to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3201"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3201",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
